<title>USA: Gerber Scientific names president/COO.</title>
<headline>Gerber Scientific names president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH WINDSOR, Conn. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gerber Scientific Inc said Tuesday it had appointed Michael Cheshire president, chief operating officer and a director.</p>
<p>Cheshire was formerly president of General Signal Corp's Electronic Group, Gerber said.</p>
<p>The COO title was formerly held by Gerber Chairman and Chief Executive George Gentile.</p>
